{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    ".inplace, .newTab, .newTabNoFocus, .newWindow." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ".inplace, .newTab, .newTabNoFocus, .newWindow."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ".inplace、.newTab、.newTabNoFocus、.newWindow。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A code-filled list over ItemsView in two flavors: string ids (identity stays stable while indexes shift) and pure indexes (content follows position). Toggle the item identity and drive the same incremental actions — inserting at the top keeps row content in the id flavor but renumbers it in the index flavor; Reset rebuilds the whole list." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A code-filled list over ItemsView in two flavors: string ids (identity stays stable while indexes shift) and pure indexes (content follows position). Toggle the item identity and drive the same incremental actions — inserting at the top keeps row content in the id flavor but renumbers it in the index flavor; Reset rebuilds the whole list."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "基于 ItemsView 的代码填充列表，提供两种味：字符串 id（顺移后身份保持稳定）与纯索引（内容跟随位置）。切换条目身份、驱动同一组增量操作——在顶部插入时，id 味的行内容不动、索引味整段重新编号；Reset 整体重建列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dual-thumb slider for picking a range. Drag a thumb, click the track, or drag between the thumbs to slide both together (width kept). Tab to a thumb for keyboard: ←/→ adjust, PageUp/PageDown larger steps, Home/End to the bounds." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A dual-thumb slider for picking a range. Drag a thumb, click the track, or drag between the thumbs to slide both together (width kept). Tab to a thumb for keyboard: ←/→ adjust, PageUp/PageDown larger steps, Home/End to the bounds."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "双滑块范围选择控件：可拖动滑块、点击轨道跳转，或拖动两滑块之间的选区整体平移（保持宽度）。Tab 聚焦滑块后可用键盘：←/→ 调整，PageUp/PageDown 大步进，Home/End 到边界。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A RadioButtons-like single-select group built from AppBarToggleButtons laid out by a VariableSizedWrapGrid. Only one item stays checked; tapping the checked item does not uncheck it. Items are identified by their tag string." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A RadioButtons-like single-select group built from AppBarToggleButtons laid out by a VariableSizedWrapGrid. Only one item stays checked; tapping the checked item does not uncheck it. Items are identified by their tag string."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由 AppBarToggleButton 组成、VariableSizedWrapGrid 自动布局的单选按钮组，行为类似 RadioButtons：同一时刻仅一项选中，点击已选中项不会反选。项目以 tag 字符串标识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stable-integer-id flavor (database primary keys) is deliberately not provided: reading a boxed integer back returns an opaque IInspectable (as? Int always fails), so it would need an unboxing shim in the projection fork first." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A stable-integer-id flavor (database primary keys) is deliberately not provided: reading a boxed integer back returns an opaque IInspectable (as? Int always fails), so it would need an unboxing shim in the projection fork first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "稳定整数 id 味（数据库主键）目前刻意未提供：读回的装箱整数是不透明 IInspectable（as? Int 恒失败），需先在投影 fork 补解箱 shim。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After insert/remove the index flavor re-numbers content by position; realized containers not re-prepared by the repeater are reconciled on the next layout pass (displayedIndex vs getElementIndex)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After insert/remove the index flavor re-numbers content by position; realized containers not re-prepared by the repeater are reconciled on the next layout pass (displayedIndex vs getElementIndex)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "插入/移除后，索引味按位置重新编号内容；repeater 未重发 elementPrepared 的已实现容器，会在下一轮布局对账（displayedIndex 对比 getElementIndex）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All items" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All items"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App-level new window entry — used when there is no WindowContext at hand. The forceMinimalMode flag enables a viewer-style window that does not pollute the main window's NavPane preference." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App-level new window entry — used when there is no WindowContext at hand. The forceMinimalMode flag enables a viewer-style window that does not pollute the main window's NavPane preference."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用级新建窗口入口——手头没有 WindowContext 时使用。forceMinimalMode 标志可创建查看器式窗口，且不会污染主窗口的导航窗格偏好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App.context.openNewWindow" : {
