    "appendIds(_:) / insertIds(_:at:) / removeIds(_:) — incremental updates of the id flavor; the index flavor does the same with append(_:), insert(_:at:) and the inherited removeIndexes(_:). Realized items, selection and scroll position are preserved." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "appendIds(_:) / insertIds(_:at:) / removeIds(_:) — incremental updates of the id flavor; the index flavor does the same with append(_:), insert(_:at:) and the inherited removeIndexes(_:). Realized items, selection and scroll position are preserved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "appendIds(_:) / insertIds(_:at:) / removeIds(_:) —— id 味的增量更新；索引味对应 append(_:)、insert(_:at:) 与继承的 removeIndexes(_:)。已实现条目、选择与滚动位置都保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
