    "selectedIds / selectedIndexes — selection readouts. The index flavor has no id dimension (identity is the index), so selectedIndexes is its native readout; ItemsView exposes no native selection set and its selectionChanged args are an empty shell." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "selectedIds / selectedIndexes — selection readouts. The index flavor has no id dimension (identity is the index), so selectedIndexes is its native readout; ItemsView exposes no native selection set and its selectionChanged args are an empty shell."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "selectedIds / selectedIndexes —— 选择读取。索引味没有 id 维度（身份即索引），selectedIndexes 就是它的原生读出；ItemsView 不暴露原生选中集，selectionChanged 事件参数是空壳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "selectionChanged reports the tag of the newly checked item. The button sets selectedTag programmatically — same commit path, same event." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "selectionChanged reports the tag of the newly checked item. The button sets selectedTag programmatically — same commit path, same event."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "selectionChanged 回报新选中项的 tag。按钮演示程序化设置 selectedTag——与用户点击走同一条 commit 路径、触发同一事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set isClickEnabled = true to turn the whole row into a button. Logs on click." : {
