    "The components wrap that pattern in two flavors sharing one base (ItemsViewBase): ItemsView keys items by string id (content stable across index shifts), ItemsIndexView feeds the repeater index straight into makeView (position is the identity)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The components wrap that pattern in two flavors sharing one base (ItemsViewBase): ItemsView keys items by string id (content stable across index shifts), ItemsIndexView feeds the repeater index straight into makeView (position is the identity)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "组件将该模式封装为共享同一基座（ItemsViewBase）的两种味：ItemsView 以字符串 id 标识条目（顺移后内容稳定），ItemsIndexView 把 repeater 索引直接喂给 makeView（位置即身份）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The index flavor never reads itemsSource element values back — the internal vector is only a count-and-change-notification carrier — so it needs no unboxing primitives at all." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The index flavor never reads itemsSource element values back — the internal vector is only a count-and-change-notification carrier — so it needs no unboxing primitives at all."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "索引味从不读回 itemsSource 的元素值——内部向量只是计数与变更通知的载体——因此完全不依赖任何解箱原语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The projection lets Swift types implement WinRT interfaces: the container factory pools cleared containers in recycleElement and reuses them in getElement (mirroring WinUI's ItemTemplateWrapper + RecyclePool), replacing the former XAML string template." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The projection lets Swift types implement WinRT interfaces: the container factory pools cleared containers in recycleElement and reuses them in getElement (mirroring WinUI's ItemTemplateWrapper + RecyclePool), replacing the former XAML string template."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投影允许 Swift 类型实现 WinRT 接口：容器工厂在 recycleElement 里把清除的容器入池、在 getElement 里取池复用（对齐 WinUI 的 ItemTemplateWrapper + RecyclePool 模式），取代了此前的 XAML 字符串模板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
