    },
    "For comparison: native detail-label ToolTip (slight jitter on move) and leading-aligned labels away from the rail." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For comparison: native detail-label ToolTip (slight jitter on move) and leading-aligned labels away from the rail."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对照组：原生 ToolTip 悬停详情（移动时有轻微抖动），标签左对齐、远离滚动条。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verifies the AnnotatedScrollBar projection end to end: wiring to a ScrollView via ScrollPresenter.VerticalScrollController, wiring to the framework ItemsView via its VerticalScrollController property, Labels populated through the projected IVector, the DetailLabelRequested event, the Scrolling event with Cancel, and SmallChange." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verifies the AnnotatedScrollBar projection end to end: wiring to a ScrollView via ScrollPresenter.VerticalScrollController, wiring to the framework ItemsView via its VerticalScrollController property, Labels populated through the projected IVector, the DetailLabelRequested event, the Scrolling event with Cancel, and SmallChange."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "端到端验证 AnnotatedScrollBar 投影可用性：经 ScrollPresenter.VerticalScrollController 接到 ScrollView、经其 VerticalScrollController 属性接到框架 ItemsView，两条接线；经投影 IVector 填充 Labels；DetailLabelRequested 事件；带 Cancel 的 Scrolling 事件；以及 SmallChange。"
          }
        }
      }
